# Evoked Grief still has Bot2 reveal its hand (a hand of Mountains), but no card in it is nonland, so nothing is discarded: the
# graveyard stays empty and the Mountains are still in hand. Grief is sacrificed by the evoke trigger all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Grief
Dark Ritual
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Grief.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
Bot1.Choose(Dark Ritual)
[Bot1.Main2]
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Graveyard = Grief
